  "allowed_claims": [
    "fr2_desk is a distinct physical environment and sensor unit relative to our earlier fr1_xyz experiments, per the separate TUM source review.",
    "The inspected CUT3R paper and pinned representative train configs do not list TUM RGB-D as a training dataset.",
    "S8 can be described as a held-out scene for this local study if the local frozen protocol is followed.",
    "Exposure of this released intermediate checkpoint to the exact TUM sequences during upstream training remains unverified."
